---
title: System-Level Flow — Vehicle Entry Authorization
---
flowchart TD
    A[Vehicle approaches gate] --> B[LiDAR detects presence\nin trigger zone]
    B --> C{Vehicle detected?}
    C -- No --> B
    C -- Yes --> D[Arm system:\ncapture frame + point cloud]

    D --> E[ALPR Subsystem]
    D --> F[LiDAR Subsystem]

    E --> G[Plate number +\nconfidence score]
    F --> H[Vehicle class +\nconfidence score]

    G --> I[Decision Fusion Engine]
    H --> I

    I --> J{Check authorization}
    J --> K[Allowlist lookup]
    J --> L[Blocklist lookup]
    J --> M[Time-window check]
    J --> N[Override check\n- guard / dashboard -]

    K --> O{Verdict}
    L --> O
    M --> O
    N --> O

    O -- AUTHORIZED --> P[Open gate]
    O -- DENIED --> Q[Deny entry\nlog reason]
    O -- LOW CONFIDENCE --> R[Alert guard\nvia dashboard]

    P --> S[Gate opens]
    S --> T[Hold open:\nLiDAR monitors\nvehicle passing]
    T --> U{Vehicle cleared\ngate zone?}
    U -- No --> T
    U -- Yes --> V[Close gate]

    Q --> W[Log event to SQLite\nwith plate image + timestamp]
    V --> W
    R --> W
    W --> X[Push event to dashboard\nvia WebSocket]
    X --> Y[Return to idle]
    Y --> B

    style E fill:#4a9eff,color:#fff
    style F fill:#22c55e,color:#fff
    style I fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
    style P fill:#16a34a,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#dc2626,color:#fff
    style R fill:#f59e0b,color:#fff
